+Alternatively, you can use the status type to write rules that are independent of the status symbol:
+
+```css
+li.task-list-item[data-task-status-type="IN_PROGRESS"] .task-list-item-checkbox {
+        box-shadow: 0 0 10px green;
+}
+```
